:: neck {"position": "250,775", "size": "100,100"}
Can you see the Adidas/Fanatics logo through the neck?

The Adidas or Fanatics logo should be a patch on the back of the jersey. It should not be embroidered directly to the jersey.
The exception to this is the 2016 World Cup of Hockey jerseys. 

(link: "❌ Yes")[(set: $flags to $flags + 1)(set: $flagnames to $flagnames + (a: "Adidas/Fanatics logo visible inside neck"))(go-to: "band")]
